#YANEURAOU-DB2016 1.00
// Small YaneuraOu-format opening book fixture for unit tests.
// Entries are sorted by SFEN (ascending) as the on-the-fly reader's on-disk binary search requires.
// Block A: the position after 7g7f (white to move) — sorts before the initial position.
sfen lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 2
3c3d 2g2f -20 28 40
8c8d none 10 28 30

# Block B: the initial position, with a few candidate moves (including a `none` ponder).
sfen lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1
7g7f 3c3d 50 32 100
2g2f none 40 32 60
6i7h none 5 8 10
